  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dissemination, communication of findings and learning from evaluations 2017-2018 - Publication, dissemination of findings and learning from evaluations 2018</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Spridning, erfarenhetsredovisning och l&#xe4;rande f&#xf6;r utv&#xe4;rderingar 2017-2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida finances annually a large number of evaluations and studies focusing on performance management and learning in the assistance. Some evaluations are ordered by Sida&apos;s partners or other donors - they are not covered by this decision. Some evaluations / studies order Sida and delegated foreign authorities, it is the one that concerns them. The aim of the initiative is to increase the dissemination, knowledge and learning of these evaluations through digital publishing and printing for the publication series for which PME is responsible. The effort makes it easier to publish by PME developing templates and support, agreeing on a model for publishing and deposited funds.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida finansierar varje &#xe5;r ett stort antal utv&#xe4;rderingar och studier med fokus p&#xe5; resultatstyrning och l&#xe4;rande i bist&#xe5;ndet. Vissa utv&#xe4;rderingar best&#xe4;lls av Sidas samarbetsparter eller andra givare - de omfattas inte av detta beslut. Vissa utv&#xe4;rderingar/studier best&#xe4;ller Sida och delegerade utlandsmyndigheter, det &#xe4;r  dem denna insats ber&#xf6;r. M&#xe5;let med insatsen &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka spridning av, kunskap om och l&#xe4;rande fr&#xe5;n dessa utv&#xe4;rderingar genom digital publicering och tryckning f&#xf6;r de publikationsserier som PME ansvarar f&#xf6;r. Insatsen g&#xf6;r det l&#xe4;ttare att publicera genom att PME tagit fram mallar och st&#xf6;d, enats om en modell f&#xf6;r publicering samt avsatt medel.</narrative>
  </description>
